<title>USA: TABLE-Weider Q4 proforma shr up before charge.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Weider Q4 proforma shr up before charge.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in millions except per share amounts)</p>
<p>		   Twelve Months Ended	   Three Months Ended</p>
<p>			     May 31			    May 31</p>
<p>	   1997		Percent	1997		Percent</p>
<p>	 Proforma	1996  Increase  Proforma  1996  Increase</p>
<p> Sales	    $218.6   $186.4    17%	$67.2  $58.0  16%</p>
<p> Net Income	 16.7     15.0    12%	  5.5    4.9  13%</p>
<p>Earnings per</p>
<p>  share	     0.68     0.61    12%	 0.22   0.20  13%</p>
<p>NOTES: Proforma earnings exclude previously announced one-time charges of $2.1 million ($1.3 million after tax) resulting from June 1996 adoption by the company of SFAS No. 121 and $14.5 million ($8.9 million after tax) attributable to compensation expense recognized in connection with the IPO.</p>
<p>Proforma interest expense is reflected as if $45.6 million of the net proceeds from the IPO were received at the beginning of the year.</p>
<p>Full co name is Weider Nutrition International Inc.</p>
